1
00:00:00,164 --> 00:00:02,004
(Amy:)There sure are a lot
of little kids here.

2
00:00:02,166 --> 00:00:04,446
(Penny:)I can't believe we thought this
would makes us feel grown up.

3
00:00:04,735 --> 00:00:07,015
(Bernadette:)I can't believe the waiter
thought I was your daughter.

4
00:00:10,174 --> 00:00:13,174
(Amy:)Last time I got dressed up
and had tea was when I was five.

5
00:00:13,344 --> 00:00:16,124
(Amy:)Just me, my teddy bear,
Raggedy Ann and my hamster.

6
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,950
(Bernadette:)-That's cute.
-It was.

7
00:00:18,349 --> 00:00:20,589
Until my hamster ate all her babies.

8
00:00:23,121 --> 00:00:25,161
(Amy:)It got less cute really fast.

9
00:00:27,024 --> 00:00:29,434
(Bernadette:)-Should we leave?
-There's a bar in the lobby.

10
00:00:29,794 --> 00:00:30,934
(Bernadette:)I could go for a drink.

11
00:00:31,262 --> 00:00:33,972
(Amy:)Aw. Drinking in the afternoon,
just like her mommy.

12
00:00:47,545 --> 00:00:49,025
(James Earl Jones:)Let me guess.

